<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="c22065c52dc1468ba7764d54649b99f1">说明：画布 - 异常监控治理</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="0fe97c7d02634d5eb61f6cc7655ccc64" />
<h1 nodeId="a035f15a4c684fd2ba6b05b8cefdd009">一、背景</h1>
<ul nodeId="f63aa9eb0d2146b68021eeed85b7ecb7">
<li nodeId="966eb7779c0649f8817fbf685b26df71">
<p align="start" nodeId="bdb2987f15564944bc4a88e38ac76890">存量告警多且杂乱，业务治理无从下手，告警治理效率低</p>
</li>
<li nodeId="76e808de5f604daa958e2f36d391602f">告警量较大需要一定维度的聚合告出，便于业务查看处理</li>
<li nodeId="b7378f92bf324d48a40c474927b71ad2">未明确各类作业异常类型，业务无法自行配置满足需求的告警信息</li>
</ul>
<h1 nodeId="f3013571f52d45d68cb4c209759edad3">二、名词释义</h1>
<p nodeId="3f6ce1f5a9ad475cae4e0f8502d90b5f">异常类型：即各作业配置、执行、结果过程中出现的异常情况信息。具体可参考<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1445694255" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1445694255" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="c6c18d2b17b04b7e964d6214478a966b">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1445694255</a></p>
<p nodeId="b25af959fd9d4a9299f56e192611ef33">监控治理：对各作业配置监控信息并对告警信息进行压制或治理</p>
<h1 nodeId="242fcdf15897437fa7adc8862197efb3">三、操作指南</h1>
<h2 nodeId="eadc70f32c6b43d9a587e5776af4e6a0">3.1 配置告警</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="aec8858878a44640aabff3f9f256e374">
<tr nodeId="e51da1a678bb4cdaa11bb36d148fab75">
<th colwidth="[516]" nodeId="353480bfc9704719b03f6d7586e907a7">
<p nodeId="454372e2e4234bf0b70197e40d3487cb">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[718]" nodeId="f6a731c07aa444fc95ff167c2ab43956">
<p nodeId="3676e35876874b6182f70b361cc61e31">示例图</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="7367cdf616ca4bc494996217dc3c7061">
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="b78550cf853e4f14a7d7063d7bcdc155">
<ol nodeId="67dec78912354c87a79f60f4b49e4592">
<li nodeId="da98367e70214e8abb8689a2737bafca">新增告警配置</li>
</ol>
