<tr nodeId="4f5e8a21ba07407786827cd5c141ee9d">
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="45d0399c795541deb7e6796ed97c9ba2">
<p nodeId="d13bf824643b47db922bc7a7b1213b45">2. 指定配置的作业类型和作业id，可按照右侧规则进行批量配置</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[718]" nodeId="7f8204c1a5444561b7a20d1a976d7e38">
<p nodeId="e2fe80c7027c4f9fabb9708a01b8914f"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1445116887/13016698387?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1050.12" height="600" nodeId="c7edaf35600c4013802fe40cbb21c635" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="defb27ece4734018ad914187ee623937">
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="f3e4efd58fd743bfbb9c72369fe1e432">
<p nodeId="7be00422670e4559a29e6479d5764a75">3. 选择错误类型进行配置</p>
<p nodeId="6d861205eb7f4753b4ffbeebdf369815">        添加子规则：规则间关系为 且</p>
<p nodeId="0776c4d2f86d4c94866abd4e9cbcdde7">        添加规则：规则间关系为 或</p>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="d050dbb31b8b49b28ed3539d98882f6b">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="037273645a3f4280a35e968e91c477fa">由于窗口超限告警形式同其他异常类告警形式不同，窗口超限类异常须单独配置</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="94ea200a28894ae79aace4f000cb5ec2" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[718]" nodeId="4f125ff69cb24da486953c73bbfabb57">
<p nodeId="e59857d93e9e43c7a1213f009adde378"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1445116887/13017636077?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1167.81" height="600" nodeId="53c3ec2898d64966abb95d854f5e82b0" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="b4e01c0111f74cf7896b6c552154b1fd">
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="fa84cb6ff8c14f21be289c954d167bf4">
<p nodeId="a0c3f0f31a754497a4124efe9c552173">4. 告出方式进行配置</p>
<ul nodeId="31da149007064b3eafdb8546ec0c2f4d">
<li nodeId="b8e4028a01ca4d4996c6d16fff571f4d">定时告出：告警消息时隔多长时间通知一次</li>
</ul>
<ul nodeId="d651da86c072425696ff8bbd04646d40">
<li nodeId="02f6f37597994c7db0b70fc2a4bbb0be">聚合维度：如聚合作业维度，则每个作业发一个消息，如聚合全部数据，则全部告警发一个消息</li>
<li nodeId="392d97e674e94669a42837fc12c48960">
<p nodeId="b54fd5257fbf49149b6818c117c0a277">通知方式：必选可多选。</p>
<ul nodeId="3891b6b23fa9446fa688e99f422d40b1">
<li nodeId="a27e2098551b45b0a095a878d3f90346">大象群通知-近线引擎告警群</li>
<li nodeId="93e5b4ec87d345cca938ec9d3728d93c">
<p nodeId="9b3a58dd68b24b3db12acc886a3609c7">大象通知（个人）：</p>
<ul nodeId="e6569b49498f4008987c6248edbc46bb">
<li nodeId="35fae2696da84202b7c36e4d83371308">告警负责人：用户可自定义告警负责人，若不填则默认为值班研发</li>
<li nodeId="d614a8809bad497ca7fae75755127b98">告警通知人：包括任务创建人、任务最后修改人、自定义通知人。</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td colwidth="[718]" nodeId="9bb8ee5fa6404d96952c118e7722b61e">
<p nodeId="639c367e98094f35a63c1e9ebbe923c1"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1445116887/13020012209?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="873" height="357" nodeId="d769e95ee8d34a059f7f3d5e494c92a1" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
